WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Copy a PDF and find it instantly in Kept.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Open the copied file from your clipboard history.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Choose Edit PDF without opening another app.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Click supported text and edit it in place.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Add and position a reusable signature.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Copy the finished edit and continue your workflow.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Paste or share the edited PDF directly from Kept.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.500
Your clipboard, upgraded: edit PDFs, images, and videos before you paste.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:47.650
Clipboard history and paste queue, together in one Mac app.
